  "title": "Chef John&#39;s Pumpkin Pie",
  "description": "The best pumpkin pie recipe is made with a rich, custard-like filling that&#39;s easy to make with sweetened condensed milk, egg yolks, and spices.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
